<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 07:25:37 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>恒星流模拟表明，银河系自身的引力可以模仿暗物质线索</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/milky-ways-own-gravity-can-mimic-dark-matter-clues-stellar-stream-simulations-suggest</link><description>我们银河系中的大多数恒星都整齐地排列在一个平面上。但我们银河系周围的空间要混乱得多。被称为“恒星流”的流氓恒星带绕着银河系运行，就像太阳系中的行星绕着太阳运行一样。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/milky-ways-own-gravity-can-mimic-dark-matter-clues-stellar-stream-simulations-suggest2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 07:25:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/milky-ways-own-gravity-can-mimic-dark-matter-clues-stellar-stream-simulations-suggest</guid></item><item><title>光粒子揭示了二维光子气体中的临界尺度</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/light-particles-reveal-critical-scaling-in-a-two-dimensional-photon-gas</link><description>来自波恩大学、海德堡大学和墨西哥国立自治大学的一组研究人员研究了接近相变的光粒子（光子）的临界行为。这种关键的缩放行为，即热力学量在玻色-爱因斯坦凝聚之前不久变得非常大或发散，以前从未在光子气体中见过，直到研究人员成功地精确地获得了这一证明。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/light-particles-reveal-critical-scaling-in-a-two-dimensional-photon-gas.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 07:10:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/light-particles-reveal-critical-scaling-in-a-two-dimensional-photon-gas</guid></item><item><title>kiiking 的物理原理，爱沙尼亚的摇摆极限运动</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-physics-of-kiiking-estonias-extreme-sport-of-swinging</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 06:55:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-physics-of-kiiking-estonias-extreme-sport-of-swinging</guid></item><item><title>几何学为可持续材料工程提供了新框架</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/geomimicry-offers-a-new-framework-for-engineering-sustainable-materials</link><description>当工程师向大自然寻求灵感时，他们通常会转向生命系统。鸟类的飞行影响了飞机的设计，壁虎的脚启发了新的粘合剂，荷叶导致了自清洁表面的发展。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/geomimicry-offers-a-new-framework-for-engineering-sustainable-materials2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 06:40:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/geomimicry-offers-a-new-framework-for-engineering-sustainable-materials</guid></item><item><title>ATLAS 和 CMS 缩小了孪生希格斯粒子的生产范围</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/atlas-and-cms-narrow-in-on-twin-higgs-production</link><description>找到一个希格斯玻色子已经够困难的了，但大型强子对撞机 (LHC) 的物理学家正在寻找更难以捉摸的东西：成对的希格斯玻色子。在最近的&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/atlas-and-cms-narrow-in-on-twin-higgs-production.jpg" /&gt; 由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 06:25:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/atlas-and-cms-narrow-in-on-twin-higgs-production</guid></item><item><title>低氧可能会限制昆虫躲避气候变暖的上坡逃生</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/low-oxygen-could-limit-insects-uphill-escape-from-climate-warming</link><description>根据《功能生态学》杂志上的一篇新评论，高海拔地区氧气水平和气压的降低可能会限制昆虫向上爬坡以逃避气候变暖的能力，这可能会对它们提供的基本服务（如授粉）产生潜在影响。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/low-oxygen-could-limit-insects-uphill-escape-from-climate-warming.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 06:10:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/low-oxygen-could-limit-insects-uphill-escape-from-climate-warming</guid></item><item><title>快速但容易出错的人工智能在五周内帮助解决了数十年之久的流体力学问题</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/fast-but-error-prone-ai-assists-in-solving-a-decades-old-fluid-mechanics-problem-in-five-weeks</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 05:55:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/fast-but-error-prone-ai-assists-in-solving-a-decades-old-fluid-mechanics-problem-in-five-weeks</guid></item><item><title>SuperCDMS 开始在地下深处用 24 个低温晶体寻找光暗物质</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/deep-underground-supercdms-begins-hunting-light-dark-matter-with-24-cryogenic-crystals</link><description>在寻找自然界最难以捉摸的物质之一——暗物质（占宇宙所有物质的 85%）的过程中，科学家们正走向极端。在地下深处，温度接近绝对零，超低温暗物质搜索 (SuperCDMS) SNOLAB（世界上最灵敏的暗物质搜索之一）已开始收集第一批科学数据。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/deep-underground-supercdms-begins-hunting-light-dark-matter-with-24-cryogenic-crystals.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 05:40:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/deep-underground-supercdms-begins-hunting-light-dark-matter-with-24-cryogenic-crystals</guid></item><item><title>从侧手翻到后空翻，运动模仿框架教三个机器人动态运动</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/from-cartwheels-to-backflips-motion-imitation-framework-teaches-three-robots-dynamic-movements</link><description>腿式机器人，即具有通常类似于动物或人类的腿的机器人系统，可能有利于在家庭环境或人口稠密的动态空间中完成任务。这些机器人可能看起来像人类或动物，但它们通常无法在短时间内可靠地复制复杂的全身运动。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/from-cartwheels-to-backflips-motion-imitation-framework-teaches-three-robots-dynamic-movements2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 05:25:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/from-cartwheels-to-backflips-motion-imitation-framework-teaches-three-robots-dynamic-movements</guid></item><item><title>镜像分子引导电子自旋并提高钙钛矿太阳能电池效率</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/mirror-image-molecules-steer-electron-spins-and-lift-perovskite-solar-cell-efficiency</link><description>有些分子有两种“手形”形式。这种称为手性的特性不仅会影响分子与光的相互作用，还会影响它们允许通过的电子自旋。大阪大学的研究人员开发出了新型手性空穴传输材料，为这种不寻常的效应提供了新的线索，同时也改善了钙钛矿太阳能电池的界面。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/mirror-image-molecules-steer-electron-spins-and-lift-perovskite-solar-cell-efficiency2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 05:10:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/mirror-image-molecules-steer-electron-spins-and-lift-perovskite-solar-cell-efficiency</guid></item></channel></rss>